# Source drops and working files. Raw renders, supplier photography and archives
# get normalised into assets/<product>/*.webp before use; the originals stay out of
# the repo. Several are 2 MB+ each, and assets/greenlightpics is ~25 MB of imagery
# the README documents as AI-generated and unusable.
#
# Only .webp is tracked under assets/<product>/, so a new product folder is covered
# automatically rather than needing another line here.
*.zip
assets/greenlightpics/
assets/*/*.png
assets/*/*.jpg
assets/*/*.jpeg
# Real assets live flat at assets/<product>/<name>.webp, so anything nested one
# level deeper is a source-drop folder (e.g. "assets/panel/Panel New/").
assets/*/*/
assets/mask/women lounging.webp
